 greatdane/macos/PRIVACY-MANIFEST.md   | 18 +++++++++++++-----
 greatdane/macos/PrivacyInfo.xcprivacy | 22 +++++++++++++---------
 3 files changed, 38 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

